# Summary

The charter states: Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter.[[cite:obs-16c64ec09c58e26817207f5e9f6a0a002b213652 "Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter."]]

The annex states: Ordinary contributions: one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January.[[cite:obs-dd921a138b0ce30560790eed7607dba28d3a5f94 "Ordinary contributions: one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January."]]
